WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.043
MyCampusView Academy.

2
00:00:03.093 --> 00:00:06.843
AI for Young Builders, video 11.

3
00:00:06.893 --> 00:00:09.930
Talk to a real AI, safely.

4
00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:15.262
Now you know how chatbots work, it is time to use one,

5
00:00:15.312 --> 00:00:16.840
safely and cleverly.

6
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:21.285
Here is what happens to your message.

7
00:00:21.335 --> 00:00:25.503
First, a safety check looks for personal details.

8
00:00:25.553 --> 00:00:30.238
Then the language model predicts a reply, word by word.

9
00:00:30.288 --> 00:00:34.543
Then the reply is checked again before you see it.

10
00:00:34.593 --> 00:00:37.900
Blocked messages never reach the model.

11
00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:42.623
The message you send is called a prompt.

12
00:00:42.673 --> 00:00:45.104
Tell me about space is vague.

13
00:00:45.154 --> 00:00:50.324
Explain in three short points why Mars looks red, for a Class

14
00:00:50.374 --> 00:00:52.036
7 student, is clear.

15
00:00:52.086 --> 00:00:56.400
It says what you want, how long, and who it is for.

16
00:00:57.750 --> 00:01:02.397
If the answer is too hard, ask it to explain more simply.

17
00:01:02.447 --> 00:01:03.963
Ask for an example.

18
00:01:04.013 --> 00:01:08.166
And when it tells you a fact you will use, check it

19
00:01:08.216 --> 00:01:11.050
in a textbook or a trusted website.

20
00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:13.528
And stay safe.

21
00:01:13.578 --> 00:01:19.228
Never type your name, address, phone number, school or passwords.

22
00:01:19.278 --> 00:01:24.490
If anything the AI says worries you, stop and tell an adult.

23
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.169
Let us recap.

24
00:01:27.219 --> 00:01:30.825
A prompt is the message you give an AI.

25
00:01:30.875 --> 00:01:35.231
Say what you want, how long, and who it is for.

26
00:01:35.281 --> 00:01:39.169
Keep personal details out and check facts.

27
00:01:39.219 --> 00:01:42.450
Next: Fair AI: when data is unfair.
